diff --git a/CHANGES/1800.misc.rst b/CHANGES/1800.misc.rst
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..1696fe0
--- /dev/null
+++ b/CHANGES/1800.misc.rst
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Improved the Pydantic v2 JSON schema for :class:`yarl.URL` so generated schemas describe URI references more accurately and clarify yarl's canonical string serialization.
diff --git a/docs/index.rst b/docs/index.rst
index ee4c4fb..c1ae4df 100644
--- a/docs/index.rst
+++ b/docs/index.rst
@@ -176,6 +176,11 @@ The :class:`~yarl.URL` could be used as a field type in pydantic_ models seamles
    class Model(BaseModel):
        url: URL
 
+The generated JSON schema describes the field as a string URL reference,
+which matches both absolute URLs and relative references accepted by
+:class:`~yarl.URL`. The schema also notes that serialized values use yarl's
+canonical string form.
+
 
